<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Agrium said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Agrium said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Agrium Inc was raised by Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette to an outperform from its prior rating of market perform, according to a trading source.</p>
<p>-- Agrium shares were up C$0.50 to C$19.35 in early trading Friday on the Toronto Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- They rose 1/8 to 14-1/8 in early trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
